---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import { site } from '../../site.config.mjs';
const a = site.contact.address;
const p = site.privacy;
---
<Base title="Terms of website use"
      description="The terms on which Regent Orthodontics' website is provided: that the information here is general rather than clinical advice, what you may do with the site, and the law that governs it.">
  <PageHead eyebrow="Terms of use"
            title="What this website is, and is not."
            lede="These terms govern your use of this site. The short version: everything here is general information to help you decide whether to come and see us, and none of it is advice about your teeth." />

  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose narrow">
      {p.confirmed === false && (
        <p class="warnbar"><span>This page reproduces POL-56, the practice's terms of website use.
          It takes effect when the practice opens to patients, which cannot happen until RQIA has
          granted registration.</span></p>
      )}

      <div class="blk">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>This site is operated by {site.legal.companyName} (Companies House
          {' '}{site.legal.companyNumber}), trading as {site.name}, of {a.street}, {a.locality},
          {' '}{a.region}, {a.postcode}. Dental care at the practice is provided by professionals
          registered with the {site.compliance.regulator.name}.</p>
        {/* El registro de RQIA está en trámite y la clínica no abre hasta que
             se conceda. Se dice así, y no como un hecho consumado. */}
        <p>The practice does not open to patients until the Regulation and Quality Improvement
          Authority has granted registration.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="blk">
        <h2>The information here is general</h2>
        <p>Nothing on this website is individual clinical advice and it is not a substitute for a
          consultation. What is here is general, and it is given in good faith to help you decide
          whether to come and see us. Whether a particular treatment suits you can only be decided
          after an examination, and nothing written here creates a clinician–patient relationship.</p>
        <p class="em">If you have a dental problem that needs attention, contact us or your own
          dentist. If you have a medical emergency, call 999.</p>
        <p>We take care to keep the site accurate and up to date, but we do not warrant that
          everything on it is complete or current at all times. Fees, treatment options and
          availability change.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="blk">
        <h2>Using the site</h2>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li><span>You may view, download and print pages for your own use, or to discuss
            treatment with someone else</span></li>
          <li><span>You must not use the site in any way that is unlawful, that could damage or
            impair it, or that interferes with anyone else's use of it, and you must not attempt to
            gain unauthorised access to it or to any system connected to it</span></li>
          <li><span>You must not use an automated system to extract data from the site, copy
            substantial parts of it, or republish its content as your own</span></li>
          <li><span>Where the site lets you send us something, what you send must be accurate, must
            be yours to send, and must not be unlawful, defamatory, offensive or a breach of
            anyone's privacy. We may remove anything that is not</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="blk">
        <h2>Content belonging to us and to others</h2>
        <p>The content of this site — text, images, photographs, the practice name and the logo —
          belongs to us or is used with permission, and is protected by copyright and trade mark
          law. You may not reproduce it commercially without our written agreement. Clinical
          photographs of patients appear only with their separate written consent.</p>
        <p>If you believe anything on this site infringes your rights, tell us and we will look
          into it promptly.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="blk">
        <h2>Links</h2>
        <p>Where we link to another website we do so because we think it may be useful. We do not
          control those sites and are not responsible for their content or their privacy practices.
          You may link to our home page provided you do so fairly and do not suggest an association
          or endorsement that does not exist.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="blk">
        <h2>Our liability</h2>
        <p>We do not exclude or limit our liability for death or personal injury caused by our
          negligence, for fraud or fraudulent misrepresentation, or for anything else that cannot
          lawfully be excluded.</p>
        <p>Subject to that, we are not liable for loss arising from your use of this website or
          from reliance on the general information published on it, and we do not warrant that the
          site will be uninterrupted or free from viruses.</p>
        <p>Nothing in these terms affects your rights as a consumer, including under the Consumer
          Rights Act 2015, and nothing here limits our responsibilities to you as a patient.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="blk">
        <h2>Privacy and cookies</h2>
        <p>How we handle information about you is explained in our
          {' '}<a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>, and what this site stores on your device — in
          short, nothing — is explained on our <a href="/cookies">cookies page</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="blk">
        <h2>Changes and governing law</h2>
        <p>We may change these terms from time to time; the version in force is the one published
          here. These terms, and any dispute arising from them or from your use of this site, are
          governed by the law of Northern Ireland, and the courts of Northern Ireland have
          jurisdiction.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow{max-width:72ch}
  .blk{padding:34px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .blk:first-of-type{border-top:0;padding-top:0}
  .prose a{color:var(--gold-dim)}
  .prose .em{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}
  .warnbar{margin-bottom:30px}
</style>
